diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index df7d40a..762448f 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -7,3 +7,14 @@ first request may have succeeded.
 
 An audit event is written before retrying. The audit trail must not contain
 the idempotency key. Receipt and attempt summaries are for display only.
+
+## Public API
+
+`reserve(transport, audit, request_id, sku, quantity)` returns the remote
+response. A `TransportTimeout` after the final attempt propagates to the
+caller. The transport receives the same payload and the same idempotency key
+on every attempt for a reservation.
+
+`format_receipt` keeps the human-readable reservation label stable.
+`summarize_attempts` joins attempt outcomes for diagnostics; it does not
+control transport behavior or decide whether another request is safe.
